{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "I've curated a look that balances professional polish with your distinct style. The mint blouse offers a fresh, cool tone perfect for autumn days at 18 degrees, while the structured blue trousers ground the silhouette. I included the silvery belt to define your waist without adding bulk, and the light blue bag complements the outfit's color story perfectly. Even the warm brown scarf is chosen as a versatile layer you can easily tuck away or move to your neck when the office heating kicks in, ensuring comfort throughout your workday.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the mint blouse into the high-waisted blue trousers to highlight your defined waist and create a sleek, vertical line."
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [],
  "swap": {},
  "named": [],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#185·09",
      "text": "This mint-colored silk blouse features a clean V-neckline and a relaxed, sleeveless cut. Its soft, fluid fabric drapes elegantly over the shoulders, providing a cool and comfortable touch for your workplace environment."
    },
    {
      "n": "#136·15",
      "text": "The lilac headband features large, faceted crystals set against a black velvet band. It adds a touch of playful elegance to your look and can be easily removed if you prefer your hair down for the day."
    },
    {
      "n": "#59·39",
      "text": "These loose-fitting trousers are crafted in a rich blue hue, offering ample comfort and ease of movement. Their wide-leg silhouette creates a sophisticated line that flows effortlessly as you walk through the office."
    },
    {
      "n": "#273·21",
      "text": "This brown cashmere scarf brings warmth and texture to your ensemble. Its ribbed knit structure provides cozy insulation for cooler autumn days while adding a touch of understated luxury."
    },
    {
      "n": "#434·40",
      "text": "This silvery belt features a sleek, modern buckle that serves as the perfect finishing detail. It cinches the waist to accentuate your figure and adds a polished metallic contrast to the soft fabrics of your outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#318·40",
      "text": "This light blue crossbody bag offers a convenient way to carry your essentials with style. Its structured shape and subtle pebbled texture provide an elegant, professional finish that complements the mint blouse perfectly."
    },
    {
      "n": "#40·11",
      "text": "These blue loafers are designed with a classic silhouette suitable for office wear. Their smooth upper and comfortable sole allow you to navigate long days at work without sacrificing comfort or style."
    }
  ]
}
